e.","source_url":"https://campusnews.fresnostate.edu/july-17-2023/12-spaces-on-campus-to-find-serenity","source_title":"12 spaces on campus to find serenity","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-07-17","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The source describes the site but does not establish unrestricted interior access; obey posted greenhouse and laboratory controls.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"leon-s-peters-event-plaza","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Leon S. Peters Event Plaza","title":"Claim a tier instead of another indoor chair","subtitle":"Outdoor tiered seating at the Resnick Student Union","notes":"Use the tiered plaza for a between-class pause or informal meetup, leaving event routes and any reserved sections clear.","short_summary":"An outdoor extension of the student union built around stepped seating, grass, and evening lighting.","evidence_claim":"Fresno State Campus News identifies the Leon S. Peters Event Plaza at the Resnick Student Union as an outdoor tiered seating area with cement seating, grass, and embedded lights.","source_url":"https://campusnews.fresnostate.edu/july-17-2023/12-spaces-on-campus-to-find-serenity","source_title":"12 spaces on campus to find serenity","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2023-07-17","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Outdoor access can be affected by university events or reservations; follow barriers, signs, and campus access rules.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"reflection-pathway","subject_type":"place","entity_name":"Reflection Pathway","title":"Take the dry-river-bed route","subtitle":"A designed walkway in front of the Resnick Student Union","notes":"Use the pathway for a deliberate lap between tasks, noticing the dry-river-bed design rather than treating it only as a sh